      "test_text": "For subletting, a landlord-and-tenant relationship exists between tenant and sub-tenant and the incidents of letting or tenancy identified by the supplied opinion are present: transfer of an interest in the estate, payment of rent, and the right to possession as against the tenant in respect of the premises sublet.",
